# Notifications

Notifications are user-facing side effects and should be decoupled from core writes where practical.

Potential events:
- new message
- message reaction
- correction received
- partner request/acceptance
- learning reminder
- mention/reply
- moderation/security event

## Rules

- Respect user notification preferences.
- Do not notify blocked users.
- Do not leak private message content into notification payloads.
- Keep notification payloads minimal.
- Persist notification state if the app has an in-app notification center.
- Use a queue for high-volume/non-critical notification delivery when the architecture supports it.
- Make delivery retry-safe.

Never store raw secrets in notification records.
